  Description: Prerequisite Region - High Seas You seek to join the Free Captains
    of the Shackles and have learned everything you need to know about sailing and
    bossing people around. Now you just need a crew and a ship. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Sailing Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Coercion] skill feat.
